433 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (evaluates whether a feature and the target variable are independent or dependent by comparing observed and expected frequencies. If a feature is strongly dependent on the target, it is considered important and kept; otherwise, it can be discarded. This method is mainly used for categorical data and is especially popular in classification tasks like text analysis.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
